  "jomKeBentongGallery": "Galeri Bentong",
  "jomKeBentongDesc": "Historical place in Bentong",
  "jomKeBentongFull": "Jom Ke Bentong Gallery is a cultural and historical gallery that introduces visitors to the heritage of Bentong. It showcases old photographs, traditional tools, and stories about the town’s development from a mining settlement into a modern district.",

  "jandaBaikTitle": "Janda Baik, Pahang",
  "jandaBaikDesc": "Let’s explore the scenery in Janda Baik",
  "jandaBaikFull": "Janda Baik is a peaceful eco-tourism village surrounded by rainforest, rivers, and waterfalls. It is popular for homestays, jungle trekking, and nature activities, offering visitors a calm escape from busy city life.",

  "bentongWalkTitle": "BENTONG WALK",
  "bentongWalkDesc": "Let’s take a walk at Bentong Walk",
  "bentongWalkFull": "Bentong Walk is a modern public space with food stalls, cafes, and event areas. It is a popular gathering spot, especially during weekends and evenings.",

  "lemangTokKiTitle": "Lemang Tok'Ki",
  "lemangTokKiDesc": "Famous lemang in Bentong",
  "lemangTokKiFull": "Lemang Tok'Ki is famous for traditional bamboo-cooked lemang made with glutinous rice and coconut milk. It is a must-visit food destination in Bentong.",


  "alorsetarExplorationTitle": "Alor Setar Eksploration",

  "muziumDirajaTitle": "Royal Kedah Museum",
  "muziumDirajaDesc": "Former royal palace of Kedah.",
  "muziumDirajaFull": "The Royal Kedah Museum was formerly a royal palace and now serves as a historical museum. It displays royal artifacts, historical documents, and information related to the Kedah Sultanate.",

  "menaraAlorSetarTitle": "Alor Setar Tower",
  "menaraAlorSetarDesc": "An iconic landmark of Kedah.",
  "menaraAlorSetarFull": "Alor Setar Tower is a telecommunications tower and one of Kedah’s main tourist attractions. Visitors can enjoy panoramic views of Alor Setar city and the surrounding areas from the observation deck.",

  "masjidZahirTitle": "Zahir Mosque",
  "masjidZahirDesc": "One of the oldest and most beautiful mosques in Malaysia.",
  "masjidZahirFull": "Zahir Mosque was built in 1912 and is renowned for its distinctive Moorish architecture. It serves as a major religious center and an important landmark in Kedah.",

  "balaiBesarTitle": "Balai Besar",
  "balaiBesarDesc": "Royal ceremonial hall of Kedah.",
  "balaiBesarFull": "Balai Besar is used for royal ceremonies, official state events, and coronations. The building represents the rich royal heritage and history of the Kedah Sultanate.",

  "mahathirHouseTitle": "Birthplace of Tun Dr. Mahathir",
  "mahathirHouseDesc": "Birthplace of Malaysia’s 4th and 7th Prime Minister.",
  "mahathirHouseFull": "This house is the birthplace of Tun Dr. Mahathir Mohamad and has been converted into a museum. It showcases his early life, personal background, and contributions to Malaysia’s development.",

  "muziumPadiTitle": "Paddy Museum",
  "muziumPadiDesc": "A unique museum showcasing the history of rice cultivation in Kedah.",
  "muziumPadiFull": "The Paddy Museum highlights Kedah’s heritage as the Rice Bowl of Malaysia. It features interactive exhibits, historical artifacts, and a panoramic gallery that illustrates the evolution of rice farming from traditional methods to modern agricultural technology.",

  "tamanJubliTitle": "Golden Jubilee Park",
  "tamanJubliDesc": "A recreational park for families.",
  "tamanJubliFull": "Golden Jubilee Park is a green recreational space suitable for leisure activities such as jogging, walking, and family outings. It is a popular relaxation spot among locals.",

  "pekanRabuTitle": "Pekan Rabu",
  "pekanRabuDesc": "A famous traditional market in Kedah.",
  "pekanRabuFull": "Pekan Rabu offers a variety of local products including traditional food, clothing, and handicrafts. It is a must-visit destination for tourists seeking an authentic local market experience.",

  "kualaKedahTitle": "Kuala Kedah Beach",
  "kualaKedahDesc": "A well-known fishing village area.",
  "kualaKedahFull": "Kuala Kedah Beach is famous for its coastal views and fresh seafood. The area is a popular destination for visitors who want to enjoy local seafood and seaside scenery.",

  "royaleTitle": "Nasi Lemak Royale",
  "royaleDesc": "A famous Kedah-style nasi lemak.",
  "royaleFull": "Nasi Lemak Royale is well known for its fragrant rice served with rich curry gravy, fried chicken, and a variety of flavorful side dishes.",

  "meeShamTitle": "Mee Sham Roti Doll",
  "meeShamDesc": "A traditional noodle dish from Kedah.",
  "meeShamFull": "Mee Sham is a traditional Kedah noodle dish served with a sweet and thick gravy, often enjoyed together with roti doll or fritters.",

  "laksaTelukKechaiTitle": "Laksa Teluk Kechai",
  "laksaTelukKechaiDesc": "A famous Kedah laksa with thick and tangy fish broth.",
  "laksaTelukKechaiFull": "Laksa Teluk Kechai is a popular Kedah dish known for its thick fish-based broth with a tangy flavor from tamarind and local spices. It is a favorite among locals and represents the unique laksa heritage of Kedah.",

  "yasmeenTitle": "Yasmeen Nasi Kandar",
  "yasmeenDesc": "Popular Indian Muslim cuisine in Alor Setar.",
  "yasmeenFull": "Yasmeen Nasi Kandar is well known for its wide selection of curries and flavorful dishes. It is a favorite dining spot for lovers of Indian Muslim food.",

  "gulaiPanasTitle": "Gulai Panas Mak Teh",
  "gulaiPanasDesc": "A famous traditional hot curry dish.",
  "gulaiPanasFull": "Gulai Panas Mak Teh is renowned for its authentic taste and rich blend of local spices. It is a popular choice for visitors who want to experience traditional Kedah cuisine.",

  "skydeckTitle": "Skydeck Alor Setar Tower",
  "skydeckDesc": "A thrilling glass-floor observation deck.",
  "skydeckFull": "Skydeck Alor Setar Tower offers a unique experience with its glass floor, allowing visitors to enjoy breathtaking views of Alor Setar city from above. It is one of the main attractions for those seeking adventure and scenic views.",






