  "subangSunwayLagoonDesc": "Famous theme park in Bandar Sunway.",
  "subangSunwayLagoonFull": "Sunway Lagoon is one of Malaysia's most popular theme parks. It offers water attractions, wildlife areas, thrilling rides and entertainment activities suitable for families and tourists.",

